IELTS.lesson({"test": 9, "part": 2, "title": "Test 9, Part 2 — the long turn", "candidate": "samir", "script": [{"who": "examiner", "text": "Now, I'm going to give you a topic and I'd like you to talk about it for one to two minutes.", "ar": "الآن، سأعطيك موضوعاً وأريدك أن تتحدّث عنه مدة دقيقة إلى دقيقتين.", "shot": "two", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/93e218b519712f7a.mp3"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "Before you talk you'll have one minute to think about what you're going to say. You can make some notes if you wish. Do you understand?", "ar": "قبل أن تتحدّث سيكون لديك دقيقة واحدة للتفكير في ما ستقوله. ويمكنك تدوين بعض الملاحظات إن أردت. هل هذا واضح؟", "shot": "examiner", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/5a7c17f0603cb77a.mp3"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "Yes, I understand.", "ar": "نعم، واضح.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_US-joe-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/ba9408565bf3db8b.mp3"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "Here is some paper and a pencil for making notes, and here is your topic.", "ar": "هذه ورقة وقلم لتدوين الملاحظات، وهذا موضوعك.", "shot": "two", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/dcc80d495df59156.mp3"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "I'd like you to describe a film or a book that made you think.", "ar": "أودّ منك أن تصف فيلماً أو كتاباً جعلك تفكّر.", "shot": "examiner", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/bc23d33fc9c7d1fd.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a film or a book that made you think.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>what it was</li><li>when you read or watched it</li><li>what it was about</li><li>and explain why it made you think</li></ul>"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "You have one minute. I'll tell you when the minute is up.", "ar": "لديك دقيقة واحدة. سأخبرك عندما تنتهي الدقيقة.", "shot": "examiner", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/2b1e1b3092896694.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a film or a book that made you think.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>what it was</li><li>when you read or watched it</li><li>what it was about</li><li>and explain why it made you think</li></ul>"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "All right? Remember you have one to two minutes for this. Don't worry if I stop you. I'll tell you when the time is up. Can you start speaking now, please?", "ar": "حسناً؟ تذكّر أن لديك دقيقة إلى دقيقتين. لا تقلق إن أوقفتك. سأخبرك عندما ينتهي الوقت. هل يمكنك أن تبدأ الحديث الآن من فضلك؟", "shot": "two", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/12de1969ab105c17.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a film or a book that made you think.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>what it was</li><li>when you read or watched it</li><li>what it was about</li><li>and explain why it made you think</li></ul>"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "I'm going to do something slightly against type and talk about a film, partly because it would be too easy for me to talk about a book.", "ar": "سأفعل شيئاً مخالفاً قليلاً لما يُتوقّع منّي وأتحدّث عن فيلم، وذلك جزئياً لأنّ الحديث عن كتاب سيكون سهلاً عليّ أكثر من اللازم.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_US-joe-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/e78b2d96933dc606.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a film or a book that made you think.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>what it was</li><li>when you read or watched it</li><li>what it was about</li><li>and explain why it made you think</li></ul>"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "My daughters put it on last winter, here in Damascus.", "ar": "ابنتاي شغّلتاه الشتاء الماضي، هنا في دمشق.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_US-joe-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/309a35b57e645e98.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a film or a book that made you think.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>what it was</li><li>when you read or watched it</li><li>what it was about</li><li>and explain why it made you think</li></ul>"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "A long film, very slow, from somewhere in eastern Europe, and I have to admit I don't remember the title correctly, and that tells you something about what follows.", "ar": "فيلم طويل، بطيء جداً، من مكان ما في شرق أوروبا، وعليّ أن أعترف أنّني لا أتذكّر عنوانه بشكل صحيح، وهذا يقول لك شيئاً عمّا سيأتي.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_US-joe-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/0947d352c14fe68f.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a film or a book that made you think.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>what it was</li><li>when you read or watched it</li><li>what it was about</li><li>and explain why it made you think</li></ul>"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "I sat down for ten minutes out of politeness and watched the whole thing. What it's about, in the sense of plot, is almost nothing. A man travels somewhere.", "ar": "جلست عشر دقائق من باب اللياقة وشاهدته كلّه. أمّا موضوعه، بمعنى الحبكة، فلا شيء تقريباً. رجل يسافر إلى مكان ما.", "shot": "two", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_US-joe-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/c13ae46d3a349067.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a film or a book that made you think.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>what it was</li><li>when you read or watched it</li><li>what it was about</li><li>and explain why it made you think</li></ul>"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "There's a great deal of water and long silences and a scene with a candle that goes on for, I want to say nine minutes, and my daughters insist it's four, so somewhere between the two.", "ar": "فيه كثير من الماء وصمت طويل ومشهد فيه شمعة يستمرّ، أريد أن أقول تسع دقائق، وابنتاي تصرّان أنّه أربع، فهو بين الاثنتين إذاً.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_US-joe-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/efa179d96ef40965.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a film or a book that made you think.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>what it was</li><li>when you read or watched it</li><li>what it was about</li><li>and explain why it made you think</li></ul>"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "Why it made me think was not the film's subject at all.", "ar": "وسبب جعله إيّاي أفكّر لم يكن موضوع الفيلم إطلاقاً.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_US-joe-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/6f786ec3e96a6fba.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a film or a book that made you think.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>what it was</li><li>when you read or watched it</li><li>what it was about</li><li>and explain why it made you think</li></ul>"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "It was that I was bored for the first forty minutes, genuinely bored, and then at some point I stopped being bored without anything having changed on the screen.", "ar": "بل أنّني مللت في الأربعين دقيقة الأولى، مللت فعلاً، ثمّ في لحظة ما كففت عن الملل دون أن يتغيّر أيّ شيء على الشاشة.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_US-joe-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/b34eca944aa02a17.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a film or a book that made you think.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>what it was</li><li>when you read or watched it</li><li>what it was about</li><li>and explain why it made you think</li></ul>"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "And I've thought about that a great deal since, because I spend my working life telling teenagers that a poem is slow on purpose and that they should stay with it, and I had never once tested whether I could do it myself with something I wasn't already trained to like.", "ar": "وفكّرت في ذلك كثيراً منذ حينها، لأنّني أقضي حياتي المهنيّة أقول للمراهقين إنّ القصيدة بطيئة عن قصد وإنّ عليهم أن يصبروا عليها، ولم أختبر مرّة واحدة إن كنت أنا أستطيع فعل ذلك مع شيء لم أُدرَّب أصلاً على حبّه.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_US-joe-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/30b05ab99bf5b501.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a film or a book that made you think.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>what it was</li><li>when you read or watched it</li><li>what it was about</li><li>and explain why it made you think</li></ul>"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "I'd always assumed being bored was a verdict. It turns out it may just be a stage you have to go through, and I'd been teaching that for thirty years without having the evidence.", "ar": "كنت دائماً أفترض أنّ الملل حكم نهائي. وتبيّن أنّه قد يكون مجرّد مرحلة لا بدّ أن تمرّ بها، وكنت أعلّم ذلك ثلاثين سنة دون أن يكون عندي دليل عليه.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_US-joe-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/f4d905aa95b48969.mp3", "card": "<p class=\"label\">Describe</p><p class=\"prompt\">Describe a film or a book that made you think.</p><p class=\"label\">You should say</p><ul><li>what it was</li><li>when you read or watched it</li><li>what it was about</li><li>and explain why it made you think</li></ul>"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "Thank you. Have you watched it again?", "ar": "شكراً لك. هل شاهدته مرّة أخرى؟", "shot": "examiner", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/9b3f274f5d80a2b2.mp3"}, {"who": "candidate", "text": "No, and I've noticed I keep not doing it, which is probably cowardice.", "ar": "لا، ولاحظت أنّني أظلّ أؤجّل ذلك، وهذا على الأرجح جبن.", "shot": "candidate", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_US-joe-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/91f0cef1d3df05a4.mp3"}, {"who": "examiner", "text": "Thank you. That is the end of Part Two.", "ar": "شكراً لك. بهذا ينتهي القسم الثاني.", "shot": "two", "sex": "m", "voice": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "clip": "../clips/264fec5248fac38c.mp3"}], "boxes": [{"q": "Describe a film or a book that made you think.", "bullets": ["what it was", "when you read or watched it", "what it was about", "and explain why it made you think"], "long": true, "model": "I'm going to do something slightly against type and talk about a film, partly because it would be too easy for me to talk about a book. My daughters put it on last winter, here in Damascus. A long film, very slow, from somewhere in eastern Europe, and I have to admit I don't remember the title correctly, and that tells you something about what follows. I sat down for ten minutes out of politeness and watched the whole thing. What it's about, in the sense of plot, is almost nothing. A man travels somewhere. There's a great deal of water and long silences and a scene with a candle that goes on for, I want to say nine minutes, and my daughters insist it's four, so somewhere between the two. Why it made me think was not the film's subject at all. It was that I was bored for the first forty minutes, genuinely bored, and then at some point I stopped being bored without anything having changed on the screen. And I've thought about that a great deal since, because I spend my working life telling teenagers that a poem is slow on purpose and that they should stay with it, and I had never once tested whether I could do it myself with something I wasn't already trained to like. I'd always assumed being bored was a verdict. It turns out it may just be a stage you have to go through, and I'd been teaching that for thirty years without having the evidence.", "why": "not a book — the Tarkovsky one the girls put on last winter, by accident nothing happens / 3 hrs I was bored and I was wrong about boredom"}, {"q": "Have you watched it again?", "model": "No, and I've noticed I keep not doing it, which is probably cowardice.", "why": ""}], "voices": {"examiner": "piper-en_GB-alan-medium-s119", "candidate": "piper-en_US-joe-medium-s119"}});
